                "retweet_count": 334,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Obamacare was mostly about who pays. My healthcare overhaul will be about HOW MUCH is paid. Healthcare costs are a huge drain on our economy. I PROMISE to reduce overall healthcare costs as President. And not just by a little bit. #Kennedy24",
