                "quoted_status_profile_id": "3230063486",
                "quoted_status_profile_username": "ItsHambone",
                "reply_count": 1102,
                "retweet_count": 5205,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "4% of our GDP went to healthcare when my uncle was President. Today, 20% does. Our entire defense budget is $1.3 trillion. Healthcare is $4.3 trillion and 93% of Medicare claims are for chronic disease. 6% of kids had chronic disease when my uncle was President \u2014 60% today. Nobody\u2019s saying anything.",
