                "quote_count": 76,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 453,
                "retweet_count": 851,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\u201cHealthcare reform\u201d has always been about \u201cWho pays?\u201d  Wrong question. No matter who pays, as a society we pay far too much. More than double any other country in the world, And for what? Our health is worse.\n\nThe biggest cost, and the biggest drag on our nation\u2019s vitality, is chronic disease. That is where my administration will shift our focus. We are going to get this country healthy again! #KennedyShanahan24",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
