                "text": "Today, we honor Juneteenth\u2014a milestone in our history, marking freedom and resilience. As your candidate, I pledge to tackle inequality with economic empowerment, equitable education, and healthcare reform. Let's build a future where justice and opportunity are for all. Together, we can create an America that lives up to its ideals.\n\n@blacks4kennedy \n\n#Juneteenth #KennedyShanahan24",
